ource-question-number\">6</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-q6\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>• <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">7</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-q7\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> room</p><p>• <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">8</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-q8\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p><strong>Activities available:</strong></p><p>• collect <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">9</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-q9\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>• hire <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">10</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-q10\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_4_academic_listening_test_3_1.mp3"],"order_index":1},{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-p2","title":"Part 2","part_number":2,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3126007-recent_actual_test_4_academic_listening_test_3_2.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t3-l-g2-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 11-16","sourc